  "description": "Forget the rules. With the Blend Road, you decide where to go. It’s light and flexible, fast and stable – an aluminium road bike where everything comes together: Affordable for those just starting out. Comfortable to keep you engaged. Nice and clean, so you can shine – whether on fast group rides or everyday journeys. Highlights: • Carbon fork – less weight and more comfort • 40 mm tyre clearance – also suitable for gravel tyres • Hydraulic disc brakes – safe braking without compromise • Integrated cable routing – a clean look and more space on the handlebar • Ground-down weld seams¹ – seamless transitions, just like with carbon • Ready for everyday life – mudguard and kickstand separately available • UDH mounting standard – future-proof for all shifting systems The Blend Road comes with the Shimano Cues groupset featuring 2x10 gears – versatile, robust and ideal for beginners. Road bike tyres from Continental and G20 aluminium wheels combine speed, comfort and stability. The slim Selle Italia saddle offers a sporty fit and remains comfortable for a long time. Get on and let’s go. Weight: approx. 10.3 kg, may vary by up to +/- 5 % due to manufacturing tolerances, weight for matt salmon frame, size M, without pedals. ¹ Only for models in matt salmon / matt black",
